      <description>&lt;div class=&#34;float&#34;&gt;&#xA;&lt;img src=&#34;http://localhost:1313/path/to/image.png&#34; alt=&#34;Caption for the picture.&#34; /&gt;&#xA;&lt;div class=&#34;figcaption&#34;&gt;Caption for the picture.&lt;/div&gt;&#xA;&lt;/div&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;I want to improve our social systems – social services, public health, environment, transportation – to make them more efficient and impactful for those in need. I like to create and explore new data sources to generate insights and draw conclusions about the world. I have experience collaborating with non-profits to make data more accessible for non-technical audiences.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
